    "snippet": "- Thunderstorms chances will continue to focus over Southeastern Arizona and the Eastern Arizona high terrain, with low chances for lower desert storms beginning Thursday and slightly better Friday. Abundant midlevel moisture is still apparent in the wv imagery, with some lingering elevated showers/sprinkles moving through Southwest AZ into Southeast CA ahead of a remnant mesoscale vortex.",
